<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money shortage falls to 7.5 bln rand Tues.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money shortage falls to 7.5 bln rand Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell to 7.493 billion rand on Tuesday from 7.775 billion rand on Monday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
